# The editor's app menus
// File, Edit, View and Run:  each one's items and their order, a line at each break, each one's key,
// when it's greyed and when it's ticked.
// The bar itself (File · Edit · View · Run) and every title are here too;  the editor shows them in the page's language.
// What each item does is still the editor's own:  `<AppBarMenus>` in `MenuBar.tsx` fills them in, by name,
// and so are the titles that follow the editor's state (Undo's, New Example's, Duplicate's, More Examples').

app menus is an app:
	// The file differs from where it started
	its "can discard" is yes or no
	// AutoSave is on
	its "auto saving" is yes or no
	// The project has a draft to publish
	its "can publish" is yes or no
	// The page is in Run, not Edit
	its "running" is yes or no
	// The code shows, in Edit
	its "code showing" is yes or no
	// The Program panel shows under the code, in Edit
	its "program panel showing" is yes or no
	// The Inspector shows
	its "inspector open" is yes or no
	// The code shows its line numbers
	its "line numbers showing" is yes or no
	// A click in the app picks what it clicks
	its "inspecting" is yes or no
	// The project is a site, with pages at addresses:  View › Site edits it
	its "site ready" is yes or no

	to more examples:
		icon "folder open outline"
	to new file:
		titled "New File"
		icon "file outline"
		shortcut meta+N
	to new example:
		icon "file code outline"
	to save:
		titled "Save"
		icon "save outline"
		shortcut meta+S
	to discard changes:
		titled "Discard Changes"
		icon "undo"
		shortcut shift+meta+R
		enabled when its can discard is yes
	to publish:
		titled "Publish"
		icon "paper plane outline"
		enabled when its can publish is yes
	to versions:
		titled "Versions"
		icon "history"
	to duplicate project:
		icon "clone outline"
	to project settings:
		titled "Project Settings"
		icon "cog"
	to auto save:
		titled "AutoSave"
		icon "sync alternate"
		selected when its auto saving is yes
	to export project:
		titled "Export…"
		icon "download"
	to import project:
		titled "Import…"
		icon "upload"
	to home:
		titled "Home"
		icon "home"

	to undo:
		icon "undo"
	to redo:
		icon "redo"
	to part actions
	to find:
		titled "Find"
		icon "search"
	to code settings:
		titled "Code Editor Settings…"
		icon "sliders horizontal"

	to run mode:
		titled "Run"
		icon "eye"
		selected when its running is yes
	to edit mode:
		titled "Edit"
		icon "pencil alternate"
		selected when its running is no
	to site view:
		titled "Site"
		icon "sitemap"
		enabled when its site ready is yes
	to show code:
		titled "Code"
		icon "code"
		selected when its code showing is yes
	to show program panel:
		titled "Program Panel"
		icon "terminal"
		selected when its program panel showing is yes
	to show inspector:
		titled "Inspector"
		icon "info circle"
		selected when its inspector open is yes
	to inspector cards:
		icon "list"
	to show line numbers:
		titled "Line Numbers"
		icon "list ol"
		selected when its line numbers showing is yes

	to compile and run:
		titled "Compile and Run"
		icon "play"
	to restart:
		titled "Restart"
		icon "redo alternate"
	to inspect app:
		titled "Inspect App"
		icon "crosshairs"
		enabled when its inspecting is no
	to stop inspecting:
		titled "Stop Inspecting"
		icon "stop circle outline"
		enabled when its inspecting is yes
	to clear console:
		titled "Clear Console"
		icon "ban"

	its "file menu" is a menu of "more examples", "-", "new file", "new example", "-", "save", "discard changes", "publish", "versions", "duplicate project", "-", "project settings", "auto save", "-", "export project", "import project", "-" and "home" titled "File"

	its "edit menu" is a menu of "undo", "redo", "-", "part actions", "-", "find", "-" and "code settings" titled "Edit"

	its "view menu" is a menu of "run mode", "edit mode", "site view", "-", "show code", "show program panel", "-", "show inspector", "inspector cards", "-" and "show line numbers" titled "View"

	its "run menu" is a menu of "compile and run", "restart", "-", "inspect app", "stop inspecting", "-" and "clear console" titled "Run"

	its "bar menu" is a menu of "file menu", "edit menu", "view menu" and "run menu"
	its menu bar is "bar menu"
